  "description": "Official client SDK for the Beacon support platform's external APIs.\n      BeaconIntakeClient submits feedback/bug/feature/todo items to an app's\n      external intake endpoint, signed with per-app HMAC-SHA256 credentials.\n      BeaconPublicClient covers the anonymous public endpoints: customer-portal\n      ticket submit/track/reply/rate, the public knowledge base, and the\n      inbound-email webhook.",
